<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77035" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quivering motion</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυγῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.39
				</span></i>
			; esp. <i>pulsation, throbbing</i> (on <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφυγμός</span> cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.716
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλεβῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποχονδρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.26
				</span></i>
			. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́; ὑπὸ κροτάφοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				744
			</span></i>: abs., <i>palpitation of the heart</i>, a disease, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Resp.</u>
				479b21
			</span></i>; <i>twitching</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.588
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of natural
			phenomena, <i>vibration, rapid motion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				2.193
			</span></i>, al.; of meteors, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				12
			</span></i> codd.; <i>impetus</i> of a projectile, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				37.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
			</span></i>, <i>internal vibration</i> of bodies, <u>Ep.</u> I <i><span class="en">
				p.8
			</span></i> U., cf. Id. ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				1.12.5
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπαλμός</span>
			).</div>
